      47.85,
      373.69,
      537.86,
      408.76
    ],
    "text": "01. As directed by the Public Service Commission, the following three members Committee is hereby appointed interms of the Article 56 (1) of the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka in respect of theEducation Service Sector.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      421.69,
      429.53,
      432.76
    ],
    "text": "02. Hereinafter the Committee will be referred to as Education Service Committee.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      445.69,
      411.46,
      456.76
    ],
    "text": "03. The Education Service Committee is consisted of the following members :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      96.45,
      469.69,
      257.84,
      504.76
    ],
    "text": "I. Mr. M.M.N.D. Bandara (Chairman)II. Mr. E.H.M.P. Elkaduwa (Member)III. Mr. K.L.M. Thamby (Member)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      517.69,
      537.84,
      540.76
    ],
    "text": "04. The Education Service Committee shall come in to force with effect from the 20th day of October, TwoThousand and Sixteen (2016).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
